Threshold: Harvey (1997) DM-HLN |t|>3.

## Review tasks (verify against source code, NOT just JSON)

### 1. Lookahead audit (HIGHEST PRIORITY)

每 experiment script 確認:
- 預測值 forecast 是 t-step 用 information 截至 t-1 (signal.shift(1) 或 lag train_end < test_start)
- HAR rolling-window: window 結束在 t-1 才能 predict t
- Walk-forward / expanding-window: refit cutoff < test point
- semi-variance (K1301)、BPV/jump (K1303)、kernel weights (K1309): 必 lag

### 2. Number reproducibility

確認 JSON results 數字與文章一致:
- MSE 1.450 / 1.471 / 1.489 / 1.411 / 2.827
- DM stat 1.08 / 1.29 / -0.91 / 3.33 / -0.35
- p value 0.197 / 0.007 / 0.729
- jump share 7.1%, J=0 41%, dn corr 0.491
- R² 0.023 / 0.043

任一不符 → flag as discrepancy.

### 3. DM test correctness

- 是否用 Harvey-Leybourne-Newbold (1997) finite-sample correction (HLN)?
- Loss function 是否 squared error 或 QLIKE，與 article claim 一致?
- 是否考慮 autocorrelation in loss differential (HAC/Newey-West)?

