experiments/k915/k915_dcc_garch_dynamic_correlation_results.json:255:  "key_findings": "DCC-GARCH(1,1) estimated on SPY/GLD/TLT (2005-2026, 5343 obs). DCC parameters: a=0.0324, b=0.9553, persistence=0.9877. SPY-GLD dynamic correlation: mean=0.069, std=0.199, range [-0.640, 0.579]. SPY-TLT: mean=-0.245. Correlations shift significantly across VIX regimes and crisis periods. Portfolio: 50/50 SPY/GLD Sharpe=0.763, best DCC strategy (DCC Risk Parity (3 asset)) Sharpe=0.782 (net of 10bps). DM test: no significant improvement over 50/50 at Harvey |t|>3.0 threshold. DCC captures meaningful correlation dynamics but static 50/50 remains competitive due to low turnover and rebalancing premium."
