experiments/k517/k517_monthly_overnight_results.json:739:  "conclusion": "Monthly SPY signal strategies DO NOT meet listing criteria. Best strategy (Strategy 2: Monthly VIX Signal (VIX<20 \u2192 hold)): Net Sharpe=0.820 (vs VT 0.840), Cross-OOS 4/5, Harvey t=3.294. Monthly SPY conditioning is not a significant improvement over simple 8.63/VIX VT. The overnight gap alpha (K515/K516) does not translate to monthly timing improvement because: (1) monthly aggregation dilutes the daily signal, (2) SPY\u2192Taiwan lead-lag is mostly in overnight gap (K502: 77-93%), (3) simple VIX-based VT already captures the relevant risk-off signal.",
