experiments/k1255_intraday_seasonality_pilot/README.md:15:K1100g 系列（d1–d8）daily-scale TAIFEX gap²→intraday r² 預測 DM 卡在 Harvey |t|>3 之下；K1100h 已開 Phase 0 scoping 試圖用 tick → 5/15-min grid + intraday periodic dummies 突破。**K1100h 的本質還是 PRG 框架的 grid-level 延伸**：單一 GARCH recursion + periodic dummies + h_{n-1} cross-session bridge。
experiments/k1255_intraday_seasonality_pilot/README.md:61:**Go/no-go criterion (vs K1100h)**：若 K1100h Phase 1 結果顯示 "PRG with periodic dummies on TAIFEX tick" 已 Harvey PASS 且差異 plot 顯示 dummy φ_s 已捕捉 U-shape → K1255 仍有獨立價值（multiplicative ≠ additive；SPY + 0050.TW vs TAIFEX；FFF vs dummies — 任何一條都是 publishable comparison）。**故 go**。
experiments/k1255_intraday_seasonality_pilot/README.md:123:- **DM test**: Harvey-HLN adjusted, lag = ⌈N^{1/3}⌉
experiments/k1255_intraday_seasonality_pilot/README.md:124:- **Harvey threshold**: |t| > 3.0 為 main；|t|>1.96 only secondary direction
experiments/k1255_intraday_seasonality_pilot/README.md:136:### 4.5 Sample-size sanity (Harvey scaling)
experiments/k1255_intraday_seasonality_pilot/README.md:142:HAC 打 3-5 折後：realistic +1.7 ~ +2.8（marginal）；optimistic +5+。**故 M2 vs M0 過 Harvey 是合理 expectation**。
experiments/k1255_intraday_seasonality_pilot/README.md:166:- **Mitigation**: K1255 **不碰 TAIFEX**（鎖 SPY + 0050.TW）；differentiation 額外靠 multiplicative component + FFF + external q_t plug-in。**Phase 1 啟動前再次 check K1100h 進度**：若 K1100h 已 Harvey PASS, K1255 重點放在 cross-market replication & FFF vs dummies methodological comparison；若 K1100h NULL，K1255 接力測試 multiplicative spec 是否突破 (alternative mechanism hypothesis)
