experiments/k1309/README.md:21:- **NULL outcome**: |t| < 3 on all 4 assets → 加入 NULL trilogy → 與 K1301/K1303/K868 packaged 成 "intraday RV path/decomposition NULL synthesis" paper appendix 或 member 文章
